(7729406, 1272762, 38162, '<td valign="top">My 9 sticks out for very little reason. One of my fav spots in Manhattan and a great angle to capture the moment. Kind of caught between not enough movement and the foreground person so prominent. Im sure you tried many takes.  Lots of anti-NYC here at DPC might be a factor as well.</td>', 'My 9 sticks out for very little reason. One of my fav spots in Manhattan and a great angle to capture the moment. Kind of caught between not enough movement and the foreground person so prominent. Im sure you tried many takes.  Lots of anti-NYC here at DPC might be a factor as well.', '2022-09-09 11:14:56.000000', NULL, 0),
