(7729454, 1272530, 30049, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the kind words.  Very much appreciated.<br/> <br/>kobi (<img border="0" src="https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif" xalt="'' . substr(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/> <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=91360" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">ytshuva</a>) - I suppose it''s just like anyplace in that you adapt to your surroundings.  Camping, hiking, learning basic survival skills (water purification, compass navigation, emergency shelter, etc...) come with growing up here for those that are adventurous.  Woodlands make for an amazing playground.  :-)<br/></td>', 'Thank you all for the kind words.  Very much appreciated. kobi ( ytshuva) - I suppose it''s just like anyplace in that you adapt to your surroundings.  Camping, hiking, learning basic survival skills (water purification, compass navigation, emergency shelter, etc...) come with growing up here for those that are adventurous.  Woodlands make for an amazing playground.  :-)', '2022-09-11 15:47:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7740373, 1272559, 83313, '<td valign="top">Critique per your request: The light isn''t anything interesting here. The main subject appears to be the brooch. The highlights on it seems a little overexposed, so it loses detail. Most of the remainder of the image is out of focus, so there really isn''t anything for the viewer''s eye to grab onto.</td>', 'Critique per your request: The light isn''t anything interesting here. The main subject appears to be the brooch. The highlights on it seems a little overexposed, so it loses detail. Most of the remainder of the image is out of focus, so there really isn''t anything for the viewer''s eye to grab onto.', '2023-03-17 23:59:22.000000', NULL, 0);
